WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.960
Welcome to our final topic for Lesson 3.

00:00:03.960 --> 00:00:11.040
Your team has a plan, but what happens when they hit the first inevitable roadblock?

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.520
Your role as coach isn't to clear the road for your team.

00:00:14.520 --> 00:00:20.280
It's to help them develop the skills to navigate it for themselves.

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:23.071
Coaching through roadblocks is about fostering

00:00:23.071 --> 00:00:25.680
resilience and problem-solving, reinforcing

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:31.680
the idea that obstacles are a part of the process, not a sign of failure.

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:35.480
A team's 90-day plan was derailed by a budget cut.

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.380
The manager's first question wasn't, how do we fix this?

00:00:38.380 --> 00:00:43.000
It was, okay, this is our new reality given this constraint.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.600
What are we still able to accomplish?

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.440
What creative solutions does this force us to consider?

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:53.800
This empowered the team to find a new path forward.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:59.920
Your play is to anticipate one potential roadblock for your team's 90-day goal.

00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.400
Write it down.

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:03.342
Now formulate one powerful,

00:01:03.342 --> 00:01:08.160
open-ended question you can ask to kick-start their problem-solving

00:01:08.160 --> 00:01:10.840
if that roadblock appears.

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:13.359
A new urgent corporate responsibility drops

00:01:13.359 --> 00:01:15.760
in the middle of your team's 90-day plan.

00:01:15.760 --> 00:01:18.450
How do you use the framework to help the team

00:01:18.450 --> 00:01:20.960
adapt with agility without losing momentum

00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:22.760
or burning out?

00:01:22.760 --> 00:01:25.360
Turn to the agility coaching drill in your

00:01:25.360 --> 00:01:27.960
playbook and walk through this scenario to

00:01:27.960 --> 00:01:30.480
prepare your response.

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.540
This concludes Lesson 3.

00:01:32.540 --> 00:01:36.365
You now have the 90-Day Way as your leadership operating system,

00:01:36.365 --> 00:01:37.800
a plan for yourself, and

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:41.940
the tools to align your team and coach them through challenges.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:45.123
In our next lesson, activating your M.V.P.

00:01:45.123 --> 00:01:48.760
will focus on leading the execution of that plan

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:51.280
under real-world pressure.

00:01:51.280 --> 00:01:52.280
Well done.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:53.280
You got this.

00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.240
Now make it happen.

00:01:55.240 --> 00:01:57.160
I'll see you in the next lesson.
